<title>USA: Fingerhut Cos Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Fingerhut Cos Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands of dollars, except share and per share data)</p>
<p>					    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			Thirteen Weeks Ended  Fifty-Two Weeks Ended</p>
<p>			   Dec. 27,  Dec. 29,   Dec. 27,   Dec. 29,</p>
<p>				  1996     1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenues	     $  742,495  740,356 $2,027,356 $2,077,344</p>
<p> Net earnings	     31,500   30,327     40,159     50,858</p>
<p> Earnings per share	  .65	.63	  .83	 1.05</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares (000's)	  48,473   48,466     48,628     48,479</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 earnings include additional pre-tax provisions for uncollectible accounts of $22 million, or $0.29/shr after-tax. Provisions cover costs related to systems error reported in Q3, and exposure from sales generated in 1995 Q4 that had deterioration in credit performance. Earnings for 1995 Q4 include additional pre-tax provisions of $22 million, or $0.30/shr after-tax.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
